    {"id":"trans-002","sentenceId":"trans-002","order":2,"tags":["question","travel"],"text":"¿Dónde está la estación de metro?","englishReference":"Where is the метро station?","start":3.774,"end":6.822,"duration":3.048},
    {"id":"trans-003","sentenceId":"trans-003","order":3,"tags":["question","travel"],"text":"¿Dónde está la parada de autobús?","englishReference":"Where is the bus stop?","start":7.572,"end":10.812,"duration":3.24},
